# 🎮 Pixel Horde — Game Design Document

> **Genre:** Co-op Horde Survival · **Players:** 1–4 · **Round:** 8–10 min
> **Tech:** Phaser 3 + TypeScript · **Art:** Pixel Art 16×16 · **Platform:** Mobile + PC

---

## 1. System Architecture

### 1.1 High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["🖥️ Client (Phaser 3 + TypeScript)"]
        UI["UI Layer<br/>HUD / Menus / Overlays"]
        GE["Game Engine<br/>Phaser 3 Scenes"]
        ECS["Entity System<br/>Players / Enemies / Projectiles"]
        NET_C["Network Client<br/>Socket.IO Client"]
        AUDIO["Audio Manager<br/>SFX + Music"]
        INPUT["Input Manager<br/>Touch / Keyboard / Gamepad"]
    end

    subgraph Server["⚙️ Server (Node.js + Socket.IO)"]
        NET_S["Network Server<br/>Socket.IO"]
        GM["Game Manager<br/>Room / Session"]
        AUTH["Auth State<br/>Player Identity"]
        SIM["Server Simulation<br/>Authority Logic"]
        DB["Data Store<br/>SQLite / JSON"]
    end

    UI --> GE
    GE --> ECS
    GE --> AUDIO
    INPUT --> GE
    NET_C <-->|WebSocket| NET_S
    NET_S --> GM
    GM --> SIM
    GM --> AUTH
    SIM --> DB
```

### 1.2 Architecture Pattern

| Layer | Pattern | รายละเอียด |
|-------|---------|------------|
| **Game Scenes** | State Machine | `Boot → Preload → MainMenu → Lobby → Game → GameOver → Leaderboard` |
| **Entities** | Component-Based | แต่ละ Entity ประกอบด้วย Components (Health, Movement, Combat, etc.) |
| **Networking** | Client-Authoritative with Server Validation | Client ส่ง input → Server validate → broadcast state |
| **UI** | Observer Pattern | UI subscribe กับ game events เพื่อ update HUD |
| **Skills** | Strategy Pattern | แต่ละ Skill เป็น class ที่ implement `ISkill` interface |
| **Spawner** | Factory + Weight-based RNG | สร้างศัตรูจาก config ด้วย weighted random |

### 1.3 Networking Model

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant P1 as Player 1 (Host)
    participant S as Server
    participant P2 as Player 2

    P1->>S: createRoom()
    S-->>P1: roomCode: "ABCD"
    P2->>S: joinRoom("ABCD")
    S-->>P1: playerJoined(P2)
    S-->>P2: roomState(players)

    Note over P1,P2: Game Start

    loop Every Frame (60fps client / 20 tick server)
        P1->>S: input { move, skillUse }
        P2->>S: input { move, skillUse }
        S->>S: simulate(inputs)
        S-->>P1: gameState { entities, scores }
        S-->>P2: gameState { entities, scores }
    end

    Note over S: Round Timer 8-10 min

    S-->>P1: gameOver { stats, xp }
    S-->>P2: gameOver { stats, xp }
```

### 1.4 Core Game Loop

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Input] --> B[Move Players]
    B --> C[Auto Attack<br/>Nearest Enemy]
    C --> D[Spawn Enemies<br/>Wave System]
    D --> E[Update Entities<br/>AI / Physics]
    E --> F[Check Collisions]
    F --> G[Apply Damage]
    G --> H{Enemy Dead?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Drop XP Gem]
    H -->|No| E
    I --> J{Level Up?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Show 3 Random Skills<br/>Player Picks 1]
    J -->|No| A
    K --> A
```

